Package: dcomp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, docker.io | docker-ce
Description: declarative container composition engine used by asys
 dcomp runs systems of Docker components wired through Unix-socket
 channels, with per-state-root namespaces and optional group-shared
 state. Ships dcomp, dcomp-proxy and dcomp-healthcheck.
